    "detailed_description": "Goblin Quest is an immersive fantasy sandbox with a nonlinear storyline.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThus allowing you to play the story your way, with the player choice being our guiding gameplay mechanic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter finding yourself in the border prison within the forest, you can escape into the Eben Hinderlands, where you start to build out your story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom playing the hero who saves the lands, the chief who rules their people, the stronghold master, or the villain who desires world domination and everything in the middle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDelve into Strongholds, fight against wildlife, raid people on the King\u2019s Road, or wage war throughout the Eben. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll while discovering supporters who can aid you in multiple ways. Such as becoming a Chiefs, Right Hand, or bodyguard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your weapons, armor, and homes you unlock as you play the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWho will you save, enlist, or discover as you traverse the lands?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world will adapt and respond to your actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou decide your fate.",
